.So, it\'s not certain; the information clearly indicates that Imperium is not feuding with Diamond Mine, which includes Ivy Nile.\n\n</think>.\n\nThe statement is false because Imperium is feuding with Diamond Mine, which includes Ivy Nile. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
