from statement 3). Therefore, she is not picky (statement 4) and spends time eating and socializing (statement 5). Therefore, the statement is true because she is not picky, so the first part is true.\n\nYes, so the answer is A) True.\n</think>\n\nThe statement is true because Mary is not a picky eater, as deduced from the context.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
