onfirm Steinhauer as the winner.It explicitly states he wasn\'t the winner, leaving room for certainty.\n\nHence, the statement that Steinhauer was the winner is certainly true.\n\n</think>.\n\nThe context explicitly states that Steinhauer won the 1992 du Maurier Classic, making the statement false. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
